{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "b4b3460170c5db35d3b86263f188ffbbd12af3fee4e03d682af9adecaf25d9ae", "ja": "それぞれの魔法", "zh": "各自的魔法", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a7b3483a133729af14dce7b0ff0c506a2c560f68b69f640b778dbdff13bf4228", "ja": "星梨花のピンチに間一髪駆けつける千鶴。\n形勢を立て直したエレナは、百合子に紋章を\n付与。学園長ロコの全面バックアップの元、\n魔法学園の生徒達はそれぞれの魔法特性を\n活かし、幻獣ドラゴンに立ち向かう。", "zh": "千鹤千钧一发之际赶到星梨花身边，解救了她。\n扭转局势的艾蕾娜为百合子\n赋予了纹章。在学园长ROCO的全力支持下，\n魔法学园的学生们发挥各自的魔法特性，\n迎战幻兽巨龙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1000_doragon", "source_sha256": "398c41ae1ed04971ef4d34964c295aab6983ecb721f92169a5691d7d4da36e33", "ja": "ギャオオォォーンッ！", "zh": "吼嗷嗷嗷——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "ce1b59f850f9fbba4dad01988d11c6adf0e7b3a3ddd32fe43d6d87be1f4f3552", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ……フフ、アハハハハ！　このワタシが、\nまったく歯が立たないなんて……屈辱だわ……！", "zh": "哈、哈……呵呵，啊哈哈哈哈！没想到我竟然……完全不是对手……真是耻辱……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "59c1c4491ee1f4657e176e01947e0715d3225f1ec29ec4c318cd32a9cc9de31b", "ja": "うぅ、ジュニオール……目を開けて……！\n……た、助けて……、……さん……！", "zh": "呜呜，朱尼奥尔……睁开眼睛啊……！\n……救、救命……，……先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "49f88cb8b3e6c35e55cd1a295025005508c694937e3ea8c0816432958eec50ef", "ja": "星梨花ーーーーっ！！\nドラゴン！　これでも、くらえっ！", "zh": "星梨花————！！  \n巨龙！接招吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1004_se", "source_sha256": "2b2ce4bd5813ecac9c273a17e7440ff3a9d097c13c6f5c17fc68ef09c20a1955", "ja": "ドゴォーンッ！", "zh": "轰隆──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1005_keruberosu", "source_sha256": "d12600ad2360c51335f61ec00319523c4702eeb95572516f67a254d41bf0cc4e", "ja": "ガオオォォッ！", "zh": "吼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "6a92674573aea4f42f2091cc9c638cc0f26e3470b3c5e4795f569daa4d00604d", "ja": "ち、千鶴さん……？　どうして……？\nあれ……わたし……。", "zh": "千、千鹤小姐……？为什么……？\n咦……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "f8b7961396a34b8ceb25dcea4025de1e0a7f7540f8b8db73c4a0d119ea6e600e", "ja": "星梨花、よかった……。\nだから言っただろう！　ろくなことにならないと！", "zh": "星梨花，太好了……  \n所以我不是说了吗！肯定不会有好事的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1008_keruberosu", "source_sha256": "a6c7219a21dbcf72c8ef9666c11742371be584d6370e2be38593e14d8c08e753", "ja": "ガオォッ！　グルゥゥ……ガアアァァッ！", "zh": "嗷呜！　咕噜噜……嘎啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "93fa629a0eb409b97d1149da8fd5b668fd8e205f8be78d76247a03ff8e249270", "ja": "ディバディ・シャバダ・ディア……\n花を散らす風よ、この身を包んで……はあぁっ！", "zh": "迪瓦迪·沙巴达·迪亚……\n\n吹散花朵的风啊，将我包裹吧……哈啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "19c66b436c1b03a60fabd178b7eccfe318449c647e3c4afb893d0a0fe43846c3", "ja": "高濃度のマナで目くらましをして、それを隠れみのに\n攻撃……水晶蹄の馬寮なのに、やるね？　フウカ！", "zh": "用高浓度的魔力制造目眩，再以此为掩护发动攻击……明明是水晶蹄马厩，没想到还挺能干的嘛？风花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "6a6b5624c145a830d818086b3050687a6b70074bbf8ad45e70465930e9ae4b8a", "ja": "攻撃特化が増えたから、やっと形勢逆転できそう。\nそれじゃ、戦力強化といきましょうか？", "zh": "因为增加了专精攻击的战力，终于有望扭转局势了。\n那么，就来强化战力吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "21020388894cb70b78655786f504ab8afdd03f7c03827844b5a335f6e9665941", "ja": "ユリコは、ワタシの紋章がダ～イスキだったわよね？\n特別に付けてあげるから、戦いなさい！　……えいっ！", "zh": "尤里子很喜欢我的纹章，对吧？我就特别给你戴上，去战斗吧！……嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "c82240639b1d8c31a4922eba53e9b24ec2260e1f3235b05e9ccab9da4be4cfa9", "ja": "えっ、えっ……えええーっ！？", "zh": "诶、诶……诶诶诶——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "cb86e6e526582df4fa23ceece3f16e1acb0ba6df679be1aa2a702244ad82d427", "ja": "きゃ……きゃあーっ♪　エレナさんの紋章が、\n私の体に！？　うう、美しすぎますーーーっ！", "zh": "呀……呀啊——♪ 艾蕾娜小姐的纹章，竟然在我的身上！？呜呜，实在太美了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "5f78cf47ff1afadb6c0b915d0ba48283776f87f62d5fd550aab5cd8e215a38bb", "ja": "そういうのいいから、さっさと戦って！\nきゃあっ！？", "zh": "这种事先放一边，赶紧战斗！\n呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1016_se", "source_sha256": "a6f8d28516d267536d69064832e94e8ff50586a86a26215129573ef1a517fae4", "ja": "ドーン！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "036512e8535db9795f1b3c96f4cd499fc042cc2cab9d8b827bd1f0430d72b7cc", "ja": "大丈夫ですか？　エレナ、ユリコ。\nエレナは相変わらず、防御系が弱いみたいですね。", "zh": "你们没事吧？艾莲娜、百合子。\n艾莲娜还是老样子，防御方面似乎很弱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "e33abffa2942b6ca3ed5d6d36a7002a282686a91ce4b1a7a4da8dc0f3726c2fb", "ja": "学園長！？", "zh": "校长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "e33abffa2942b6ca3ed5d6d36a7002a282686a91ce4b1a7a4da8dc0f3726c2fb", "ja": "学園長！？", "zh": "校长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "5d726a9ea18bbe2fb853266d512bda198e11ba9dc0117c07e668d667b21ebcc5", "ja": "私のかわいい生徒たち、戦闘の準備は整いましたか？\nさあ、ここからは実戦ですよ！", "zh": "我可爱的学生们，战斗准备好了吗？好了，接下来就是实战了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "b88236bb020b0953986ec0d77434c8bf0851ff1a87a0bd73443892918873c93d", "ja": "貴方達には、私がついています。\n思いきってやりなさい！", "zh": "有我陪着你们。放手去做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "c1c62e3bd2a2f16e8bea34cb27f80ea533c79ccb8e9cf120b5b3036f612afccc", "ja": "願いなさい、望みなさい、手に入れなさい！\n魔法はそのための力なの！", "zh": "许愿吧，渴望吧，把它得到手吧！魔法就是为此而存在的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_05_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "3afbda922d8318d59e1ed670338039ebb0e09f01c79733032df898ea27e4c168", "ja": "学園長……\n星梨花、私達も行くぞ！", "zh": "学园长……\n星梨花，我们也上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
